    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111504" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλό-στροφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>loving change, changeable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.168
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fond of returning</i> to a place, of bees, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Antr.</u>
				19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>inclined to return,</i> of symptoms, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>.</div>
